# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): Thickness up brings the pad path in under the chords, detuned
# pairs spread apart (the second core's voices on the FM-1). The progression's steps at Snap 80 (a pad's change: the
# old notes release on one half of the voices while the new come in on the other, over Snap's attack and release),
# at Snap 20 (a wash: the pad's voices glide with the drones) and at Snap 50 (legato: a short glide); then Thickness
# to 100 under a chord, and to 0 (the pad out). Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap HOME
turn ALGO 80
set 87 60
wait 600
wav pad.wav
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
turn ALGO 20
wait 300
tapkey 0
wait 3500
tapkey 0
wait 3500
turn ALGO 50
wait 300
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
set 87 100
wait 2500
shot pad.png
set 87 0
wait 3000
wavstop
